{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 4958062,
  "courseSlug": "remix-course",
  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34675986",
      "title": "Managing Errors Inside Components",
      "lectureOrder": 82,
      "videoOrder": 76,
      "sourceHash": "c739c47cdad85fbe6d4b3707c9d054842a9f8ea08b3fbfb89742a86ed865fd18",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.11,
          "en": "Now when it comes to error handling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.11,
          "end": 6.33,
          "en": "there is one last use case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.33,
          "end": 8.28,
          "en": "that's worth a closer look here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.28,
          "end": 11.67,
          "en": "And that would be this UpdateExpensesPage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.67,
          "end": 15,
          "en": "Now there we are loading the details,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15,
          "end": 17.97,
          "en": "when we in the end render this expense form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.97,
          "end": 20.46,
          "en": "there we use the useMatches hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.46,
          "end": 24.03,
          "en": "to find the data for a single expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.03,
          "end": 25.65,
          "en": "from that list of expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.65,
          "end": 29.16,
          "en": "that's loaded by the loader in expenses.jsx.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.16,
          "end": 32.463,
          "en": "We covered that earlier in this section already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.66,
          "end": 38.07,
          "en": "But what happens if we are looking for an expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.07,
          "end": 40.74,
          "en": "which id doesn't exist?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.74,
          "end": 45.74,
          "en": "If I manually enter ABC as an expense id in my URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.47,
          "end": 48.72,
          "en": "an empty form gets loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.72,
          "end": 50.31,
          "en": "And the reason for that simply is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.31,
          "end": 53.97,
          "en": "that we try to find an expense with a matching id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.97,
          "end": 57.603,
          "en": "but we won't find one because such an expense doesn't exist.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.56,
          "end": 62.19,
          "en": "Now what can we do in this situation then?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.19,
          "end": 65.493,
          "en": "Well, there are a couple of possible solutions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.54,
          "end": 68.4,
          "en": "For one, we can simply ignore it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.4,
          "end": 72.27,
          "en": "and that would mean that we're essentially in add mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.27,
          "end": 73.98,
          "en": "So if I now enter some data here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.98,
          "end": 75.36,
          "en": "and click safe expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.36,
          "end": 78.03,
          "en": "it will basically be added as a new expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.03,
          "end": 80.78999999999999,
          "en": "because entering an invalid expense id here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.78999999999999,
          "end": 84.48,
          "en": "is the same as visiting expenses/add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.48,
          "end": 87.15,
          "en": "There, we also won't find an expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.15,
          "end": 90.27,
          "en": "for the id because we won't have any id at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.27,
          "end": 93.03,
          "en": "So we could simply accept the fact that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.03,
          "end": 95.22,
          "en": "an invalid id in the URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.22,
          "end": 97.38,
          "en": "leads to a new expense being created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.38,
          "end": 99.39,
          "en": "if we submit this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.39,
          "end": 102.93,
          "en": "After all, it likely is a mistake by the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 102.93,
          "end": 106.56,
          "en": "if they manually entered a non-existent id here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.56,
          "end": 108.3,
          "en": "If you just click around in the app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.3,
          "end": 110.733,
          "en": "you shouldn't end up in this situation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.84,
          "end": 113.7,
          "en": "But of course we could handle this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.7,
          "end": 115.77000000000001,
          "en": "in a different way as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.77000000000001,
          "end": 117.96000000000001,
          "en": "Here in this expense form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.96000000000001,
          "end": 122.96,
          "en": "we could also check if params.id is truthy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.57,
          "end": 125.49,
          "en": "So if we're not on the add page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.49,
          "end": 127.53,
          "en": "because if we would be on the add page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.53,
          "end": 129.6,
          "en": "there wouldn't be an id at all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.6,
          "end": 132.96,
          "en": "not a non-existent id, but no id at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.96,
          "end": 134.31,
          "en": "So if we have an id,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.31,
          "end": 137.43,
          "en": "we know that we are on the added page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 137.43,
          "end": 138.93,
          "en": "But if we have an id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 138.93,
          "end": 142.47,
          "en": "and still we did not find expense data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.47,
          "end": 146.25,
          "en": "that means that we, well basically have an invalid id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 146.25,
          "end": 147.93,
          "en": "We have one, but no data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 147.93,
          "end": 150.96,
          "en": "That must be an invalid id, therefore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 150.96,
          "end": 152.73,
          "en": "And in that case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 152.73,
          "end": 155.43,
          "en": "we could of course manually return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 155.43,
          "end": 158.37,
          "en": "a different piece of jsx code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.37,
          "end": 159.39,
          "en": "We could, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 159.39,
          "end": 161.28,
          "en": "return a message where we say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 161.28,
          "end": 165.09300000000002,
          "en": "invalid expense id, something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.11,
          "end": 171,
          "en": "If I save that and I enter expenses/abc,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 171,
          "end": 173.4,
          "en": "I get invalid expense id here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 173.4,
          "end": 174.66,
          "en": "and I can still close this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 174.66,
          "end": 176.79,
          "en": "by clicking somewhere else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 176.79,
          "end": 180.78,
          "en": "So that might be the preferable way of treating that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 180.78,
          "end": 183.9,
          "en": "Alternatively, we can also throw here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 183.9,
          "end": 184.98,
          "en": "in the safe check,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 184.98,
          "end": 186.99,
          "en": "and we could throw a new response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 186.99,
          "end": 189.36,
          "en": "by using this utility Jason function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 189.36,
          "end": 191.55,
          "en": "provided by a Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 191.55,
          "end": 195.15,
          "en": "However, that is meant to be used on the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 195.15,
          "end": 197.88,
          "en": "So, we probably don't want to use it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 197.88,
          "end": 199.29,
          "en": "But, we can still generate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 199.29,
          "end": 202.92000000000002,
          "en": "a new response with the built-in response class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 202.92000000000002,
          "end": 204.78300000000002,
          "en": "that's provided by the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 206.07,
          "end": 209.34,
          "en": "If we do that, if we throw a response here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 209.34,
          "end": 213.12,
          "en": "then we indeed do end up on our error boundary",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 213.12,
          "end": 215.16,
          "en": "but not on the catch boundary.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 215.16,
          "end": 217.14,
          "en": "We can tell that this is the error boundary",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 217.14,
          "end": 219.78,
          "en": "by the content that's on this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 219.78,
          "end": 221.37,
          "en": "The reason for that simply is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 221.37,
          "end": 222.93,
          "en": "that we're throwing this response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 222.93,
          "end": 225.12,
          "en": "from inside our component function;",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 225.12,
          "end": 228.32999999999998,
          "en": "not from inside a loader or an action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 228.32999999999998,
          "end": 230.76,
          "en": "And Remix won't catch error responses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 230.76,
          "end": 231.9,
          "en": "you are throwing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 231.9,
          "end": 235.053,
          "en": "It treats this as a regular error instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 236.16,
          "end": 238.35,
          "en": "Hence, I won't use this approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 238.35,
          "end": 241.08,
          "en": "And instead simply show it as fallback message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 241.08,
          "end": 242.37,
          "en": "in the unlikely scenario",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 242.37,
          "end": 244.773,
          "en": "that we have an invalid expense id.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
